WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.818
<i>[jazz music]</i>
<i>[爵士乐]</i>

00:02.887 --> 00:10.163
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

00:15.232 --> 00:17.473
Wow,
I never thought The Low Tides
哇，
我从没想过低潮

00:17.542 --> 00:20.473
would come to a backwater town
like Bikini Bottom.
会来到一个死水小镇
比如比基尼泳裤。

00:20.542 --> 00:24.577
Squidward, I didn't know
you liked The Low Tides!
章鱼哥，我不知道
你喜欢《低潮》！

00:24.646 --> 00:26.956
[grunting, groaning]
[咕哝，呻吟]

00:27.025 --> 00:28.611
Yeah, they're fine,
是的，他们很好，

00:28.680 --> 00:34.197
but that Clair St. Claire
is the real talent!
但那个克莱尔·圣克莱尔
才是真正的人才！

00:34.266 --> 00:36.922
They say his clarinet
is so fancy,
他们说他的单簧管
是如此奇特，

00:36.991 --> 00:39.715
it doesn't play any wrong notes!
它不会演奏任何错误的音符！

00:39.784 --> 00:42.266
All right, enough nonsense!
Listen up!
好了，废话够多了！
听着！

00:42.335 --> 00:44.163
This here's the biggest concert
这是最大的音乐会

00:44.232 --> 00:46.749
to come to Bikini Bottom
in decades!
来到比基尼堡
几十年后！

00:46.818 --> 00:47.956
[sniffs]
[嗅嗅]

00:48.025 --> 00:50.301
You smell that, boyos?
你闻到了吗，男孩？

00:50.370 --> 00:51.611
[sniffs]
[嗅嗅]

00:51.680 --> 00:53.059
Ooh!
[giggles]
哦！
[咯咯笑]

00:53.128 --> 00:54.887
You smell like corn chips,
Mr. Krabs!
你闻起来像玉米片
蟹老板！

00:54.956 --> 00:56.646
I just smell the toilets.
我只是闻到厕所的味道。

00:56.715 --> 00:59.335
[flush]
- Phew!
[冲水]
- 唷！

00:59.404 --> 01:01.749
Yeah, yeah.
All that's in the air too,
是啊是啊。
一切也都在空气中，

01:01.818 --> 01:04.784
along with the smell of money!
伴随着金钱的味道！

01:04.853 --> 01:06.370
The show is sold out,
演出已售罄，

01:06.439 --> 01:11.301
which means there's
30,000 fans in there.
这意味着有
那里有30,000名粉丝。

01:11.370 --> 01:13.784
And you are gonna sell
a Krabby patty
你要卖掉
蟹肉饼

01:13.853 --> 01:15.749
to every single one of them!
致他们每一位！

01:15.818 --> 01:17.301
[gasps]
[喘气]

01:17.370 --> 01:21.025
What a great way
to make 30,000 new friends,
多么好的方法啊
结交30,000个新朋友，

01:21.094 --> 01:22.749
don't ya think Squidward, huh?
你不觉得是章鱼哥吗？

01:22.818 --> 01:24.197
Hmm?
Hmm?
唔？
唔？

01:24.266 --> 01:27.232
Don't you?
- [groans]
不是吗？
- [呻吟]

01:27.301 --> 01:30.611
And what are you going to do
while we work all day?
你打算做什么
当我们整天工作的时候？

01:30.680 --> 01:32.542
Glad you asked,
Mr. Squidward.
很高兴你问，
章鱼哥先生。

01:32.611 --> 01:36.784
I will be taking
the toughest job of all.
我将采取
最艰难的工作。

01:36.853 --> 01:39.266
I'll be sneaking onstage
我会偷偷地登上舞台

01:39.335 --> 01:42.818
to unfurl this here banner
behind the band.
在此展开此横幅
在乐队后面。

01:42.887 --> 01:44.577
[mimics fanfare]
[模仿大张旗鼓]

01:44.646 --> 01:46.128
"The Krusty Krab.
“蟹堡王。

01:46.197 --> 01:49.335
"Krabby patties are yummy.
Please your face.
“蟹肉饼很好吃。
请你的脸。

01:49.404 --> 01:50.853
Tonight would be great."
今晚会很棒。”

01:50.922 --> 01:52.853
That's the worst advertisement
I've ever seen.
这才是最烂的广告
我曾经见过。

01:52.922 --> 01:54.404
[groans]
[呻吟]

01:54.473 --> 01:56.991
What do you know about
celebrity endorser-mints?
你知道什么
名人代言薄荷糖？

01:57.059 --> 01:59.266
Just get in there
and sell me patties!
只要进去
还卖给我肉饼！

01:59.335 --> 02:02.163
Go, go, go, go, go, go, go!
走，走，走，走，走，走，走！

02:02.784 --> 02:04.094
[audience clamoring]
[观众叫嚷]

02:04.163 --> 02:05.542
Oh, boy!
哦，孩子！

02:05.611 --> 02:08.922
SpongeBob and Squidward,
working side by side!
海绵宝宝和章鱼哥，
并肩工作！

02:08.991 --> 02:11.784
The two amigos, patty purveyors,
这两个朋友，肉饼供应商，

02:11.853 --> 02:14.680
the delicious duo.
美味的二人组。

02:14.749 --> 02:17.818
Backstage, huh?
后台吧？

02:17.887 --> 02:20.439
[moans, clamoring]
[呻吟，叫喊]

02:20.508 --> 02:23.818
Mr. Squidward,
you're on in two minutes!
章鱼哥先生，
两分钟后你就开始了！

02:23.887 --> 02:25.646
[groans]
Mm-hmm.
[呻吟]
嗯嗯。

02:27.163 --> 02:30.853
Ladies and gentlemen,
it's The Low Tides
女士们、先生们，
这是低潮

02:30.922 --> 02:36.163
with their special guest,
Squidward Tentacles!
和他们的特邀嘉宾，
章鱼哥的触手！

02:37.473 --> 02:40.301
[cheers]
[干杯]

02:40.370 --> 02:43.301
<i>[big band music]</i>
<i>[大乐队音乐]</i>

02:43.370 --> 02:49.646
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

02:49.715 --> 02:52.646
[clarinet plays]
[单簧管演奏]

02:52.715 --> 02:55.094
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

02:55.163 --> 02:57.853
all: Squidward,
Squidward, Squidward!
全部： 章鱼哥，
章鱼哥，章鱼哥！

02:57.922 --> 03:03.749
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

03:03.818 --> 03:05.197
Hmm.
Huh?
唔。
啊？

03:05.266 --> 03:08.818
Concession Kings!
Bun buddies forever!
优惠之王！
永远的包子朋友！

03:08.887 --> 03:11.508
- [groans]
- Whoa!
- [呻吟]
- 哇！

03:12.818 --> 03:16.025
You know, SpongeBob,
we would cover more ground
你知道，海绵宝宝，
我们将覆盖更多领域

03:16.094 --> 03:17.818
if we split up.
如果我们分手了。

03:17.887 --> 03:21.784
Why don't you sell
to that half of the audience,
你为什么不卖
对那一半观众来说

03:21.853 --> 03:24.370
and I'll take this half!
这一半我来拿！

03:24.439 --> 03:26.163
Mmm, well, I was looking forward
嗯，嗯，我很期待

03:26.232 --> 03:27.922
to spending
the whole day with you.
支出
和你在一起一整天。

03:27.991 --> 03:31.301
I know, I'm so disappointed.
我知道，我很失望。

03:31.370 --> 03:33.956
But that is a great idea,
Squidward!
但这是个好主意
章鱼哥！

03:34.025 --> 03:36.335
I love how you always put
the Krusty Krabs's needs
我喜欢你总是这样放
蟹堡王的需求

03:36.404 --> 03:37.991
before your own.
在你自己之前。

03:38.059 --> 03:39.370
[laughs]
[笑]

03:39.439 --> 03:43.508
Yes, I do, don't I?
[chuckles]
是的，我愿意，不是吗？
[笑声]

03:44.784 --> 03:46.232
Zip!
拉链！

03:46.301 --> 03:49.163
[hums, strains]
[嗡嗡声，张力]

03:49.232 --> 03:51.197
Krabby patties!
蟹肉饼！

03:51.266 --> 03:53.508
Get your fresh,
hot patties here!
让你的新鲜，
这里有热肉饼！

03:53.577 --> 03:55.887
I'll take a Krabby Patty!
我要吃蟹肉饼！

03:55.956 --> 03:57.887
Coming right up!
马上就来了！

03:57.956 --> 03:59.473
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

03:59.542 --> 04:02.473
- Ooh!
- Watch it!
- 哦！
- 注意！

04:02.542 --> 04:04.715
Your patty, sir!
先生，你的小馅饼！

04:04.784 --> 04:06.335
Hey, Snack Boy!
嘿，小吃男孩！

04:06.404 --> 04:07.991
Krabby patty me!
蟹肉饼我！

04:08.059 --> 04:10.128
- Yo!
- What?
- 哟！
- 什么？

04:10.197 --> 04:12.335
Hmm?
唔？

04:12.404 --> 04:14.680
Hey, can I get
some mustard here?
嘿，我可以得到吗
这里有芥末吗？

04:14.749 --> 04:17.266
Mustard for the mister!
You got it!
给先生加芥末！
你明白了！

04:17.335 --> 04:19.232
[grunts]
[咕哝]

04:19.301 --> 04:22.094
all: Whoa!
全体：哇！

04:22.163 --> 04:24.818
[squeals]
Thanks, kiddo!
[尖叫声]
谢谢你，孩子！

04:25.853 --> 04:27.301
all: Huh?
全体：啊？

04:27.370 --> 04:29.577
[laughter]
[笑声]

04:30.439 --> 04:32.749
[groaning]
[呻吟]

04:34.611 --> 04:36.370
Hmm?
唔？

04:36.439 --> 04:39.749
Easy as taking money
from a baby.
拿钱一样容易
来自一个婴儿。

04:39.818 --> 04:42.715
[strains]
[菌株]

04:42.784 --> 04:46.577
No fans on the stage.
Get back to your seat!
舞台上没有粉丝。
回到你的座位上！

04:46.646 --> 04:49.542
<i>[Tommy Walker's "Charge"]</i>
<i>[汤米·沃克的“冲锋”]</i>

04:49.611 --> 04:51.853
Whoa!
哇！

04:51.922 --> 04:55.991
[laughter, groaning]
[笑声、呻吟]

04:56.059 --> 04:58.749
Whoa!
哇！

05:00.473 --> 05:04.163
Oh, man, I still can't
believe your uncle Fred
哦，伙计，我还是不能
相信你叔叔弗雷德

05:04.232 --> 05:06.818
was able to get us
backstage passes.
能够找到我们
后台通行证。

05:06.887 --> 05:08.887
Mm-hmm.
嗯嗯。

05:08.956 --> 05:11.749
Now, if I can just find
Clair St. Claire.
现在，如果我能找到
克莱尔·圣克莱尔。

05:11.818 --> 05:15.542
Oh, I'm sure he'd let
a fellow Gob Stick aficionado
哦，我确信他会让
Gob Stick 爱好者

05:15.611 --> 05:17.232
play his instrument.
演奏他的乐器。

05:17.301 --> 05:18.577
Hmm?
唔？

05:18.646 --> 05:21.266
Oh, excuse me, janitor,
哦，对不起，清洁工，

05:21.335 --> 05:23.784
do you know where
the green room is?
你知道在哪里吗
绿色房间是？

05:23.853 --> 05:27.784
That depends.
Where's your backstage pass?
这要看情况。
你的后台通行证在哪里？

05:27.853 --> 05:31.128
[whimpering]
Oh, uh, it's right...
[呜咽]
哦哦，原来如此……

05:31.197 --> 05:33.887
Huh?
Ooh!
啊？
哦！

05:35.128 --> 05:37.232
[cheers]
[干杯]

05:37.301 --> 05:39.059
He's in the band!
他在乐队里！

05:39.128 --> 05:40.784
[screams]
[尖叫声]

05:40.853 --> 05:42.197
Huh?
啊？

05:42.266 --> 05:44.266
[screams]
[尖叫声]

05:44.335 --> 05:47.439
[groans]
[呻吟]

05:47.508 --> 05:49.542
[chuckles]
[笑声]

05:49.611 --> 05:52.232
Oh, this must be it!
噢，一定是这个！

05:52.301 --> 05:54.680
Okay.
[clears throat]
好的。
[清嗓子]

05:54.749 --> 05:59.439
Clair St. Claire?
It is I, Squid... Patrick?
克莱尔圣克莱尔？
是我，乌贼……帕特里克？

05:59.508 --> 06:02.991
Sorry, I don't know anyone
named SquidPatrick.
抱歉，我谁也不认识
名叫乌贼帕特里克。

06:03.059 --> 06:05.922
Patrick you idiot,
what are you doing here?
帕特里克你这个白痴
你在这里做什么？

06:05.991 --> 06:07.542
This is my room.
这是我的房间。

06:07.611 --> 06:11.680
Did you not see the star
on the door?
你没看到星星吗
在门上？

06:15.025 --> 06:18.059
[groans]
Well, where's the green room?
[呻吟]
那么，绿色房间在哪里？

06:18.128 --> 06:20.577
I'm trying to find the band!
- I don't know.
我正在努力寻找乐队！
- 我不知道。

06:20.646 --> 06:23.094
Hey,
I'll bet my friend Stan does.
嘿，
我敢打赌我的朋友斯坦会的。

06:23.163 --> 06:24.439
Yo, Stan!
哟，斯坦！

06:24.508 --> 06:26.404
[footsteps pounding, yells]
[脚步声重重，喊叫]

06:26.473 --> 06:28.370
You...
你...

06:28.439 --> 06:31.404
Hey Stan, hey,
could you show my friend
嘿斯坦，嘿，
你可以给我朋友看吗

06:31.473 --> 06:33.508
where the green room is?
绿色房间在哪里？

06:33.577 --> 06:36.577
Don't worry.
I'll take good care of him.
不用担心。
我会好好照顾他的。

06:36.646 --> 06:40.784
- [groans]
- [laughs]
- [呻吟]
- [笑]

06:40.853 --> 06:42.853
Help me.
帮我。

06:42.922 --> 06:45.715
Bye, SquidPatrick!
Have fun!
再见，乌贼帕特里克！
玩得开心！

06:47.128 --> 06:49.818
[gulping]
[吞咽]

06:50.680 --> 06:53.197
Hey, where's my patty?
嘿，我的馅饼在哪里？

06:53.266 --> 06:54.715
[groans]
[呻吟]

06:54.784 --> 06:56.749
- Yeah, over here!
- I want one!
- 是的，在这里！
- 我想要一个！

06:58.266 --> 07:00.853
I'm a patty launching machine!
我是肉饼发射机！

07:00.922 --> 07:02.577
[laughs]
[笑]

07:03.266 --> 07:05.163
Thank you, Patty Boy!
谢谢你，帕蒂男孩！

07:05.232 --> 07:06.818
It was nothing.
没什么。

07:06.887 --> 07:09.163
Nothing!
I'm out of patties!
没有什么！
我的肉饼没了！

07:09.232 --> 07:11.749
Well, I guess I just better
make some more!
嗯，我想我只是更好
多做一些！

07:11.818 --> 07:13.887
Yup!
是的！

07:13.956 --> 07:16.163
[hums]
[哼哼]

07:16.232 --> 07:18.922
- Huh?
- [hums]
- 啊？
- [哼哼]

07:20.991 --> 07:23.542
[hums]
[哼哼]

07:23.611 --> 07:25.646
Fresh hot Krabby patties here!
新鲜热腾腾的蟹肉饼来啦！

07:25.715 --> 07:27.922
Put a patty in your pie hole!
在你的馅饼洞里放一块肉饼！

07:27.991 --> 07:29.094
Huh?
啊？

07:29.163 --> 07:31.473
Ah!
啊!

07:33.956 --> 07:38.163
Oh, it looks like I fed
my entire section.
哦，看来我吃饱了
我的整个部分。

07:38.232 --> 07:39.680
Hmm?
唔？

07:39.749 --> 07:41.335
[moans, groans]
[呻吟，呻吟]

07:41.404 --> 07:43.059
[stomach rumbles]
[肚子咕咕叫]

07:43.128 --> 07:46.059
[moans, groans]
[呻吟，呻吟]

07:49.749 --> 07:51.715
Well, I guess Squidward
wouldn't mind
嗯，我猜章鱼哥
不介意

07:51.784 --> 07:54.956
if I sell a few patties
in his section.
如果我卖一些肉饼
在他的部分。

07:56.542 --> 07:58.887
[grunts]
[咕哝]

08:01.508 --> 08:02.991
[cackles]
[咯咯笑]

08:03.059 --> 08:05.266
They'll never look
for me up here.
他们永远不会看
对我来说。

08:05.335 --> 08:07.059
Hmm.
唔。

08:07.128 --> 08:09.991
[grunts]
[咕哝]

08:11.335 --> 08:13.163
[audience cheers]
[观众欢呼]

08:13.232 --> 08:15.335
[chuckles]
[笑声]

08:15.404 --> 08:17.473
[clamoring]
[叫喊]

08:17.542 --> 08:20.025
Oh!
Whoa!
哦！
哇！

08:20.094 --> 08:22.025
Oh!
哦！

08:22.094 --> 08:24.232
Whoa!
哇！

08:25.611 --> 08:27.749
[cheers]
[干杯]

08:27.818 --> 08:29.508
Eww!
Yuck!
哇！
哎呀！

08:29.577 --> 08:32.439
Whoa!
No, no, wait!
哇！
不不不，等等！

08:32.508 --> 08:37.577
[yells, groans]
[尖叫声、呻吟声]

08:40.404 --> 08:42.025
Oh...
哦...

08:43.059 --> 08:45.025
[spits]
[吐口水]

08:45.094 --> 08:46.197
Yuck!
哎呀！

08:46.266 --> 08:48.680
Who eats yogurt at
a rock concert?
谁在吃酸奶
摇滚音乐会？

08:49.887 --> 08:52.508
All right, where am... [gasps]
好吧，我在哪里...[喘气]

08:52.577 --> 08:54.542
The stage!
舞台！

08:54.611 --> 08:57.508
Oh, forget the green room!
哦，忘了绿色房间吧！

08:57.577 --> 09:00.232
That's Clair St. Claire's
clarinet!
那是克莱尔·圣克莱尔
单簧管！

09:00.301 --> 09:02.025
[chuckles]
[笑声]

09:02.094 --> 09:05.094
<i>Ladies and gentlefish,
polyps and fries!</i>
<i>女士们，温柔的鱼，
息肉和薯条！</i>

09:05.163 --> 09:08.094
<i>Here's the band you've
all been waiting for!</i>
<i>这是你的乐队
大家都在等待！</i>

09:08.163 --> 09:11.128
<i>You know them!
You love them!</i>
<i>你认识他们！
你爱他们！</i>

09:11.197 --> 09:13.370
<i>It's The Low Tides!</i>
<i>退潮了！</i>

09:13.439 --> 09:15.508
[cheers and applause]
[欢呼和掌声]

09:15.577 --> 09:17.508
Huh?
[yells]
啊？
[喊叫]

09:19.853 --> 09:21.577
[whines]
[哀鸣]

09:26.232 --> 09:28.680
[groans]
Oh, oh, oh!
[呻吟]
哦，哦，哦！

09:28.749 --> 09:30.439
Ow, ow, ow, ow.
噢，噢，噢，噢。

09:30.508 --> 09:32.577
[cheers]
[干杯]

09:32.646 --> 09:34.439
[jazz music]
[爵士乐]

09:34.508 --> 09:36.197
[piano plays]
[钢琴演奏]

09:36.266 --> 09:38.232
♪ I was a lonely,
lonely lad ♪
♪ 我是一个孤独的人，
孤独的小伙子♪

09:38.301 --> 09:39.577
♪ Solitary soul ♪
♪ 孤独的灵魂 ♪

09:39.646 --> 09:40.956
♪ Didn't have the rock ♪
♪ 没有石头 ♪

09:41.025 --> 09:42.680
♪ And I didn't know
how to roll ♪
♪ 我不知道
怎么滚♪

09:42.749 --> 09:44.784
♪ Joined me a band,
singing on the stage ♪
♪ 加入了我的乐队，
在舞台上唱歌♪

09:44.853 --> 09:46.473
♪ They was swooning
and a-screaming ♪
♪ 他们神魂颠倒
还有尖叫声♪

09:46.542 --> 09:47.853
♪ And now I'm all the rage ♪
♪ 现在我很愤怒 ♪

09:47.922 --> 09:49.991
♪ It's a feeding frenzy ♪
♪ 这是一场疯狂的喂食 ♪

09:50.059 --> 09:52.197
♪ Everybody wants
a piece of me ♪
♪ 每个人都想要
我的一部分♪

09:52.266 --> 09:54.335
♪ It's a feeding frenzy ♪
♪ 这是一场疯狂的喂食 ♪

09:54.404 --> 09:56.818
♪ I can't get me no privacy ♪
♪ 我不能让自己没有隐私 ♪

09:56.887 --> 09:59.404
♪ How am I gonna shake 'em? ♪
- Is it really him?
♪ 我该如何摇动他们？ ♪
- 真的是他吗？

09:59.473 --> 10:00.853
♪ The freaky fans found me ♪
♪ 奇怪的粉丝找到了我 ♪

10:00.922 --> 10:02.442
♪ Man, they'll tear me
limb from limb ♪
♪ 老兄，他们会撕裂我
肢体与肢体 ♪

10:02.473 --> 10:04.404
♪ They claw at my clothes,
steal my shoes ♪
♪ 他们抓我的衣服，
偷我的鞋♪

10:04.473 --> 10:06.611
♪ Tear out my hair,
I got nothing left to lose ♪
♪ 扯掉我的头发，
我已经没有什么可失去的了♪

10:06.680 --> 10:08.818
♪ Oh, it's a feeding frenzy ♪
♪ 噢，这是一场疯狂的喂食 ♪

10:08.887 --> 10:11.646
♪ The kids can't get enough ♪
♪ 孩子们还不够 ♪

10:11.715 --> 10:14.025
♪ Oh, it's a feeding frenzy ♪
♪ 噢，这是一场疯狂的喂食 ♪

10:14.094 --> 10:17.059
♪ This rock-n-roll
is getting rough ♪
♪ 这首摇滚乐
变得粗暴了♪

10:17.128 --> 10:19.370
[clarinet plays]
[单簧管演奏]

10:19.439 --> 10:21.646
[groans]
[呻吟]

10:21.715 --> 10:22.956
Oh.
哦。

10:23.025 --> 10:25.232
Buddy, could you
put down your phone?
伙计，你可以吗
放下你的手机吗？

10:25.301 --> 10:27.266
You're blocking my shot!
你挡住了我的射击！

10:27.335 --> 10:32.542
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

10:32.611 --> 10:34.370
Ah, looks like everyone
has a patty.
啊，看来大家都一样
有一个肉饼。

10:34.439 --> 10:36.128
[burps]
[打嗝]

10:36.197 --> 10:37.784
- [yells]
- Ow, ow.
- [大喊]
- 噢，噢。

10:37.853 --> 10:40.370
Everyone but the band!
除了乐队以外的所有人！

10:40.439 --> 10:42.473
[whines]
[哀鸣]

10:42.542 --> 10:45.301
Hmm.
Oh!
唔。
哦！

10:45.370 --> 10:47.266
Aha!
啊哈！

10:47.335 --> 10:49.887
Must sell patties!
一定要卖肉饼！

10:50.853 --> 10:52.991
[beep, whirr]
[嘟嘟声、呼呼声]

10:53.059 --> 10:54.922
[strains]
[菌株]

10:54.991 --> 10:56.715
Huh?
啊？

10:56.784 --> 10:59.715
Oh!
Whoa!
哦！
哇！

10:59.784 --> 11:01.197
- Ugh!
- Whoa!
- 呃！
- 哇！

11:01.266 --> 11:03.887
[yells]
[喊叫]

11:06.956 --> 11:08.335
Whoa!
哇！

11:09.301 --> 11:10.887
[giggles]
[咯咯笑]

11:10.956 --> 11:13.646
There's no stopping me
this time!
没有人能阻止我
这次！

11:13.715 --> 11:15.439
Here we go!
开始了！

11:15.508 --> 11:17.404
A-one, a-two.
[beep]
A-一，A-二。
[嘟]

11:17.473 --> 11:18.611
Huh?
Hey!
啊？
嘿！

11:18.680 --> 11:21.473
What's going on?
这是怎么回事？

11:21.542 --> 11:23.715
Help!
[garbled speech]
帮助！
[乱码言论]

11:23.784 --> 11:27.439
[yells]
[喊叫]

11:27.508 --> 11:30.404
[sighs]
Huh?
[叹气]
啊？

11:32.749 --> 11:36.059
Special delivery
for The Low Tides!
特快专递
为了低潮！

11:37.715 --> 11:39.749
Huh?
Whoa!
啊？
哇！

11:39.818 --> 11:43.542
Ow, ow, ow, ow, ow, ow, ow, ow.
呜呜呜呜呜呜呜。

11:43.611 --> 11:46.715
Oh!
Hey!
哦！
嘿！

11:46.784 --> 11:48.646
[whimpers]
[呜咽]

11:48.715 --> 11:52.059
- [yells]
- [whimpers]
- [大喊]
- [呜咽]

11:52.128 --> 11:53.680
[all scream]
[所有人尖叫]

11:53.749 --> 11:57.266
Ow, ow, ow, ow, ow, ow, ow, ow.
呜呜呜呜呜呜呜。

11:57.335 --> 11:59.094
Come on!
快点！

11:59.163 --> 12:01.059
[screams]
[尖叫声]

12:02.818 --> 12:05.715
[groans]
[呻吟]

12:06.611 --> 12:08.197
Don't forget!
别忘了！

12:08.266 --> 12:12.266
Brought to you
by the Krusty Krab!
给你带来了
蟹堡王！

12:12.335 --> 12:17.025
The Krusty Krab.
A crummy place to eat?
蟹堡王。
吃饭的地方很糟糕吗？

12:17.094 --> 12:19.991
I didn't know they
were serving us crummy food!
我不知道他们
为我们提供了糟糕的食物！

12:20.059 --> 12:22.749
Huh?
[groans]
啊？
[呻吟]

12:22.818 --> 12:24.887
Oh, come on.
[chuckles]
哦，来吧。
[笑声]

12:24.956 --> 12:27.749
Boo!
Boo I say!
嘘！
我说嘘！

12:27.818 --> 12:29.853
[booing]
- Hey, no, no, no!
[嘘声]
- 嘿，不，不，不！

12:29.922 --> 12:31.370
You don't understand!
你不明白！

12:31.439 --> 12:33.715
It's not crummy!
[groans]
这并不糟糕！
[呻吟]

12:33.784 --> 12:36.094
It's yummy!
It's... it's...
真好吃！
这是……这是……

12:36.163 --> 12:37.473
[booing]
[嘘声]

12:37.542 --> 12:39.715
[chuckles]
[笑声]

12:39.784 --> 12:42.577
[clicking rhythmically]
- Boo!
[有节奏的点击声]
- 嘘！

12:42.646 --> 12:45.749
Ooh, that's a hot beat,
Mr. Krabs!
哦哦，这节奏太火爆了
蟹老板！

12:45.818 --> 12:47.749
[nose flute plays]
[鼻笛演奏]

12:47.818 --> 12:49.956
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

12:50.025 --> 12:52.749
Oh, they're pretty good!
哦，他们很不错！

12:52.818 --> 12:54.542
Yeah!
Let's give them a chance!
是的！
让我们给他们一个机会吧！

12:54.611 --> 12:55.956
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

12:56.025 --> 12:59.094
All right, now for a little
licorice stick!
好吧，现在稍微
甘草棒！

12:59.163 --> 13:00.646
[inhales]
[吸气]

13:00.715 --> 13:03.680
Squidward's got a clarinet!
Run!
章鱼哥有一支单簧管！
跑步！

13:03.749 --> 13:06.715
[screaming]
[尖叫]

13:06.784 --> 13:08.646
[whimpers]
[呜咽]

13:08.715 --> 13:11.335
[clarinet plays]
[单簧管演奏]

13:11.404 --> 13:17.853
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

13:17.922 --> 13:20.163
I can't believe it!
我简直不敢相信！

13:20.232 --> 13:24.094
This really is the greatest
clarinet ever made!
这确实是最伟大的
单簧管曾经制作过！

13:24.163 --> 13:28.404
And you're the greatest
audience I've ever... oh!
而你是最伟大的
我曾经的观众...哦！

13:28.473 --> 13:29.784
[crickets chirp]
[蟋蟀鸣叫]

13:29.853 --> 13:32.818
[groans]
[呻吟]

13:32.887 --> 13:34.887
Huh?
啊？

13:34.956 --> 13:36.922
Nice jam, baby.
美味的果酱，宝贝。

13:36.991 --> 13:38.922
Validation?
验证？

13:38.991 --> 13:41.887
Oh, thank you,
Clair St. Claire!
哦，谢谢你，
克莱尔圣克莱尔！

13:41.956 --> 13:45.542
Oh, this is the best day
of my life!
哦，这是最好的一天
我的生活！

13:45.611 --> 13:48.370
I can die happy!
我可以快乐地死去！

13:48.439 --> 13:50.887
[sighs]
[叹气]

13:53.439 --> 13:54.922
Oh, no, you don't!
哦，不，你不！

13:54.991 --> 13:58.818
You're working tonight,
and corpses can't collect cash!
今晚你还要工作，
而且尸体不能收取现金！

13:58.887 --> 14:00.301
[groans]
[呻吟]

14:00.370 --> 14:04.784
Well, still the best day
of my life.
嗯，仍然是最好的一天
我的生活。

嗯，仍然是最好的一天
我的生活。